<title>SINGAPORE: Bonvests to raise S$139 mln.</title>
<headline>Bonvests to raise S$139 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonvests Holdings Ltd said on Monday it planned to raise Singapore $139 million with the proposed issue of 63.4 million warrants in conjunction with a transferable loan facility.</p>
</text>
